     材质实情（2026-10-01 从 Publish 包 dump 实证）：
       blend = add_alpha · tex[0] = lwn_decal_scorch_d · alphaTest = 0
       flags = [no_depth_test, no_modify_depth_buffer, cull_front_faces]
